    "title": "Public Invited To Review And Comment On Regional Economic Development Plan - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By solomonswords ,\n1 days ago Ridgway, PA – April 10, 2026 – The North Central Pennsylvania Regional Planning and Development Commission is inviting the public to review and provide input on the draft Comprehensive Economic Development Strategy (CEDS) 2026–2030, which will guide economic growth across Cameron, Clearfield, Elk, Jefferson, McKean, and Potter Counties. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
